      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've noticed that with Clubs and events alike that there is a proliferation of groups due to the need to have separate banners for different roles, such as 'Staff' or 'Supporter'\n\nThis is true for the VRChat Club scene (VibeNight and Vibenight Staff), the Events scene (PB50 Events, PB50 Staff) and also for major events like Furality (Furality, Furality Staff Team, Furality Supporter).\n\nBeing able to have per-role banners would allow communities to work from one group, instead of needing many.\n\nAs an added enhancement, being able to select the displayed role/banner from a drop-down would also cut down on the quantity of meme/vanity groups. (Many banners could be accessed by joining a single group)\n\nFinally, having the Group Text displayed in the Nameplate was amended to \"<Group name> - <Role name>\" to match the chosen display role/banner, or showing the user's currently selected role in the 'Represented Group' section of the bio, would further decrease the need for multiple groups.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
